irst_verseªlast_verse¦verses’„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙCome, my people, enter thou into thy chambers, and shut thy doors about thee: hide thyself as it were for a little moment, until the indignation be overpast.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ´For, behold, the LORD cometh out of his place to punish the inhabitants of the earth for their iniquity: the earth also shall disclose her blood, and shall no more cover her slain.¦layout ªlast_verse